                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The packet stays\ndry in a tin\nsleeve. Page ONE\ndefines the\nservice hall. Page",
                                  "TWO grants pipe\naccess. Page THREE\nforbids closing\npublic branches\nfor private",
                                  "priority. Its seal\nmatches the\narchive square,\nnot Slush's silver\nstationery."
                                ],
