                        "children": {
                          "true": [
                            {
                              "id": "be117d39-9acb-478a-afd5-7fc661170de5",
                              "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
                              "args": {},
                              "children": {
                                "true": [
                                  {
                                    "id": "21046f6a-bdf4-4f57-abd5-806b901cc902",
                                    "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                                    "args": {}
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "id": "37f7d54c-bf5e-49a1-a1a1-d56e7e1c1652",
                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "The south chase\nhas two fitting\npositions.\nPosition A needs a\nnew hole through a",
                                        "private kitchen\nwall. Position B\nuses the existing\nservice hatch and\ncosts one extra",
                                        "elbow joint. Both\nstay within the\npressure rating,\nand the city fund\ncovers either",
                                        "joint count. The\nsigned permission\ncovers only the\nexisting hatch.\nRivet says a",
                                        "cheaper pipe does\nnot become cheaper\nif it buys an\nargument with a\ntenant."
                                      ],
